      <div style="padding:0 16px 10px;">
        <p>This calculator and guide are built and continuously maintained as an independent project.</p>
        <p>If it has helped you think more clearly, avoid a costly mistake, or saved you meaningful money, you're welcome to support its ongoing maintenance and improvements:</p>
